  "notes": "Drafted by tools/draft_server_descriptors.py from providers/form_contracts.py server.define for dolt-native. Field ids are the registration contract's own; backend_field_id is the servers API key (cde_route_<id> / cde_secret_<id> for contract fields). Review tab/group placement. Placement follows the contract groups (GROUP_TABS). Round-tripped 2026-11-04 against the pinned Dolt 1.86.6 demo (tools/tests/test_ui_descriptor_server_forms.py): draft -> servers-API payload -> persisted route via the registration contract -> live runtime identity through the provider; mapping and edit pre-fill are tested without a server."
